TTS backbone tokenizers, ported from codec.cpp's llama.cpp patches:
- soprano (patches/soprano-llamacpp.patch): lowercase + whitespace collapse,
  per-digit split, raw UTF-8 BPE with [UNK] fallback, [STOP] as eos
  (BricksDisplay/Soprano-1.1-80M-GGUF since 2026-10-20).
- chatterbox (patches/chatterbox-tokenizer-llamacpp.patch): Chatterbox T3's
  text BPE behind HF's Whitespace pre-tokenizer
  (BricksDisplay/Chatterbox-Multilingual-TTS-GGUF since 2026-10-21).
- UGM byte fallback (patches/ugm-byte-fallback-llamacpp.patch): Pocket-TTS's
  SentencePiece vocab.
--- a/src/llama-vocab.h
+++ b/src/llama-vocab.h
@@ -71,6 +71,8 @@
     LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_MMBERT            = 60,
     LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_K2_HORIZON        = 61,
     LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_FLINT             = 62,
+    LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_SOPRANO           = 63,
+    LLAMA_VOCAB_PRE_TYPE_CHATTERBOX        = 64,
 };
 
 struct LLM_KV;
